Under the patronage of Hazza bin Zayed, 
@AbuDhabiDED
 will organise the inaugural Al Ain Future Business Forum on 28-29 September 2026 at ADNEC Centre Al Ain, bringing decision-makers and experts together to help drive investment and long-term economic growth in Al Ain Region.

Organised by 
@dctabudhabi
, and supported by 
@UAEembMoscow
, the Doorway to Abu Dhabi festival is underway until 23 August 2026 in Manezhnaya Square in Moscow. The event celebrates the UAE's heritage and craftsmanship.

In partnership with 
@EADTweets
, the Sheikh Zayed Falcon Release Programme has released over 2,400 falcons in the wild since its 1995 founding, supporting wildlife conservation through initiatives that combine heritage preservation with sustainable environmental practices.
